        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "College Scorecard catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** U.S. Department of Education.\n- **Access:** Downloadable files and API.\n- **Unit:** Postsecondary institution and student-cohort summaries.\n- **Coverage:** Release-dependent historical files.\n- **Geography:** Institution, state, and nation.\n- **Join keys:** UNITID, OPEID, state, and reporting year.\n- **Measures:** Completion, earnings, debt, repayment, and aid.\n- **Use boundary:** Preserve released cohort definitions; institution averages are not individual program effects.\n\nCollege Scorecard provides career-pathway and postsecondary-return context. Its released values do not alone establish that a program caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
